        " pilgrimage_pomp_humble:0 \"Humble\"",
        " pilgrimage_pomp_humble_desc:1 \"$EFFECT_LIST_BULLET$ Bring no one from your [court|E], making [travel|E] dangerous\\n$EFFECT_LIST_BULLET$ You join a train of [EmptyScope.ScriptValue('pilgrimage_entourage_pomp_humble_max_value')] random pilgrims\\n$EFFECT_LIST_BULLET$ More [piety|E] earned on completion\\n\\n#weak Pilgrimage is a time for quiet reflection. A common pilgrim train with strangers is the best place for that.#!\"",
